      "id": "auth.import",
      "title": "Copy omp's logins (:import-logins)",
      "aliases": [
        "import-logins"
      ],
      "description": "Copies the provider logins of your standalone omp into omfp's omp, through omp's own auth export and import: only model-provider logins, never its configuration or MCP credentials. A browser (OAuth) login then lives in both apps: a provider that rotates its tokens may sign one of them out later, and you log in there again."
    },
